"""NkFBXParityDemo — banc de parite FBX / glTF du chantier « FBX operationnel »
(agent nkrenderer, 2026-08-17).

Temoin bilateral : le MEME modele (CesiumMan) charge par les DEUX chemins —
renderer::LoadGLTF (Resources/Models/CesiumMan/CesiumMan.glb, chemin prouve)
et renderer::LoadFBX (Resources/Models/CesiumMan/CesiumMan.fbx, exporte du
.glb via Blender 5.1). Les chiffres de reference du FBX viennent d'un
inspecteur independant du moteur (Python, scratchpad de session) : 23 Model,
19 LimbNode, 19 Cluster, 1 Skin, 57 AnimationCurveNode, 171 AnimationCurve.

Etape (a) squelette+noms : nodes/hierarchie/TRS. Etapes (b) skinning et
(c) animations : les checks s'ajouteront ici au fur et a mesure.

Console classique (pas une TestSuite : politique de workspace « Unit-test
execution disabled », meme contournement que NkAssetIODemo). Lancer depuis la
racine du worktree (chemins Resources/ relatifs au repertoire courant).
"""
from Jenga import *
from jengaconfig import *

with project("NkFBXParityDemo"):
    consoleapp()
    language("C++")
    cppdialect("C++17")
    location(".")
    files(["src/main.cpp"])

    nkentseudependson(
        ["NKRenderer", "NKRHI", "NKSL", "NKCollision", "NKPhysics",
         "NKSerialization", "NKFileSystem", "NKFont", "NKImage", "NKStream", "NKUI", "NKGlad",
         "NKECS", "NKEvent", "NKWindow", "NKMath", "NKTime", "NKLogger",
         "NKContainers", "NKMemory", "NKCore", "NKPlatform", "NKThreading"],
        extra_includes=["src"],
    )

    objdir("%{wks.location}/Build/Obj/%{cfg.buildcfg}-%{cfg.system}/%{prj.name}")
    targetdir("%{wks.location}/Build/Bin/%{cfg.buildcfg}-%{cfg.system}/%{prj.name}")

    with filter("system:Windows && !options:windows-runtime=uwp && !system:XboxSeries && !system:XboxOne"):
        usetoolchain(TC_WINDOWS)
        defines(["WIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN", "_UNICODE", "UNICODE"])
        links(["user32", "gdi32", "opengl32", "dwmapi", "shell32",
               "d3d11", "d3d12", "dxgi", "dxguid", "d3dcompiler", "uuid", "ole32"])
